				The Chosen Ones
				   Megadeth.
			    Killing Is My Business...

Tabbed By Mat (some time ago)

Note:   Cash donations will be greatly recieved.
        I didn't bother to arrange some of the chords properly in places,
        but the timing is obvious if you listen to the song.


Notation:	h = hammer	p = pull	.  = Palm mute
		/ = Slide up	\ = Slide Down	~  = Vibrato.

Tempo x--- = 220; 4/4 time.


